title: Does a "unique title" mean an exact title, or also an alias?
pid: 36f955fe-a586-404c-8b36-b14596f9c2f9
body: |2-
  His example needs the alias. In his public skgrepo, on 2026-11-15,
  the node he means by "love" is titled "love ,, brotherly & romantic &
  self-respect" and has the alias "love"; "humility" is an exact title.
  Many of his hub titles are lists, such as "information | knowledge |
  truth", so each '|'-separated name might count too. If he does not
  say, exact title or exact alias, case-insensitive, is the narrowest
  reading that serves both of his examples.
